              "content": "### Get tasking attempts\n-\tThis path is used for ONEDAY and ONENOWATTEMPTS requests\n-\tThis API allows to get the first possible attempts matching your criteria\n- Note that, as of today, the API responds in some cases with a 500 error\n-\tEven if the parameter is mandatory, maxCloudCover is NOT yet used for calculations.\n-\tStartDate can be set at any time. Note that if you try to set it in the past, the value will be replace by the current date\n",
